<title>SINGAPORE: Brunei sets Sept Seria Light crude at $22.20/bbl.</title>
<headline>Brunei sets Sept Seria Light crude at $22.20/bbl.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brunei has set the price of its benchmark Seria Light export crude for September at $22.20 per barrel, up from $21.05 in August, traders said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The price of Champion crude in September was set at $22.00 from $20.85 in August, the sources said.</p>
<p>Brunei has set a provisional Seria Light price for October of $23.90 and a provisional Champion price of $23.70.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3081)</p>
</text>
